---
import Layout from "~/layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const metadata = {
  title: "Privacy Policy — Daily Insight",
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl text-default">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <div
      class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-6"
    >
      <p>Last updated: October 15, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-default mt-6">
        1. Information We Collect
      </h2>
      <p>
        Daily Insight operates as a technical publication and blog. We may
        collect non-personally identifiable information automatically via
        standard web server logs and analytics tools, including browser type,
        referring pages, operating system, and timestamp data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-default mt-6">
        2. Cookies and Web Beacons
      </h2>
      <p>
        We use cookies to store information about visitor preferences and record
        user-specific information on visits. Third-party vendors, including
        Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this website
        or other websites.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-default mt-6">
        3. Google AdSense & Advertising Cookies
      </h2>
      <p>
        Google is one of the third-party vendors on our site. It uses cookies,
        known as advertising cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based
        upon their visit to Daily Insight and other sites on the internet. Users
        may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a
          href="https://adssettings.google.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-primary underline">Google Ad Settings</a
        > or <a
          href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="text-primary underline">AboutAds.info</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-default mt-6">
        4. Third-Party Content & Analytics
      </h2>
      <p>
        We may partner with analytics providers (such as Google Analytics) to
        help understand website traffic and usage patterns. These services may
        collect information sent by your browser to analyze overall site
        interactions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-default mt-6">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy,
        please reach out via our contact page or official communication
        channels.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
